{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Off-Score is a game that tells the stories of 3 songs.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a piece of paper striving to survive in the society of a copy machine..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355000/extras/65129327380b20cb7e6208c11cb9b133.poster.avif?t=1772183995\" width=616 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355000/extras/65129327380b20cb7e6208c11cb9b133.webm?t=1772183995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355000/extras/65129327380b20cb7e6208c11cb9b133.mp4?t=1772183995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To an elephant hunter that struggles with regrettable memories..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355000/extras/1f3a4bdf398a525175a980270f6843bd.poster.avif?t=1772183995\" width=616 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355000/extras/1f3a4bdf398a525175a980270f6843bd.webm?t=1772183995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355000/extras/1f3a4bdf398a525175a980270f6843bd.mp4?t=1772183995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through a song-sized universe that unfolds as you change your point of view..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355000/extras/c469636059de8f510db017aa70698cb0.poster.avif?t=1772183995\" width=616 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355000/extras/c469636059de8f510db017aa70698cb0.webm?t=1772183995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355000/extras/c469636059de8f510db017aa70698cb0.mp4?t=1772183995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These songs will bring you to 3 different worlds of fantasy and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of the game is to unlock the full length of all 3 songs, including &quot;Copy Machine&quot;, &quot;Elephants Remember&quot; and &quot;Relativity&quot;.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 interactive songs, each with its unique story and mood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point, click &amp; drag puzzle gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original jazz-singer-songwriter songs written by YenTing Lo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listening is a big part of the play experience</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each song's gameplay is strongly connected to its story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355000/extras/c9c864521ce81deae807343383c4eb52.avif?t=1772183995\" width=720 height=184 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1355000?t=1772183995","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1355000?t=1772183995","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355000/9351da09ab32dcea970be7ef2f96518b3cae773f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772183995","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355000/9351da09ab32dcea970be7ef2f96518b3cae773f